# Frontend / Component Library Standards

These standards apply when working in this directory.

## Design System

```
COMPONENT_LIBRARY_ROOT: /path/to/Component-Library
DOCS_ROOT: ${COMPONENT_LIBRARY_ROOT}/packages/ui-docs/src
```

## Available Packages

| Package | Components |
|---------|------------|
| @org/bsds-core | Button, Input, Layout, Stack |
| @org/ui-modal | Modal, Dialog |
| @org/ui-toast | Toast notifications |

## Rules

- Always check if a design system component exists before creating custom
- No hardcoded colors -- use theme tokens
- No hardcoded spacing -- use spacing scale
- Maintain WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility

## Accessibility

- All interactive elements must be keyboard-navigable
- Images require alt text
- Form inputs require labels
- Color contrast ratio minimum 4.5:1 for normal text
- Use semantic HTML elements (`<nav>`, `<main>`, `<article>`)
- Test with screen reader (VoiceOver/NVDA)
